369870820"},{"id":369088591,"date":"2026-10-25T11:52:35.023Z","text":"✨","likes":17,"restacks":2,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/89ca6b07-7ed1-4602-a4aa-cddcc83ac2fe_1672x941.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369088591"},{"id":369803817,"date":"2026-10-25T11:33:25.369Z","text":"Thanks @Cael !  Your custom cursor looks amazing. 💘\n\nhttps://magickmicaart.substack.com/p/make-your-own-custom-cursor-for-substack\n\n ✨Get Cursor!  create your own prompt builder (link below) https://magickmica.github.io/get-cursor.html","likes":6,"restacks":0,"replies":1,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":"https://magickmica.github.io/get-cursor.html","url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369803817"},{"id":369616546,"date":"2026-10-25T03:22:50.396Z","text":"The goddess within you needs rest as much as radiance.","likes":17,"restacks":4,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369616546"},{"id":369563685,"date":"2026-10-25T02:00:00.181Z","text":"🛎️ The TV stays on forever ….","likes":13,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d0d1d779-4672-436d-a476-1945474db074_1111x1974.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369563685"},{"id":369557052,"date":"2026-10-25T01:00:40.591Z","text":"Imagine a timeline where you stop apologizing for the light you bring into the room. What would you create there?","likes":13,"restacks":3,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369557052"},{"id":369554931,"date":"2026-10-25T00:55:57.720Z","text":"❤️💎🧡💛🌠💚💎💙💜\n\nRest. Reboot. Re-enter the magick.","likes":6,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9947370a-2bf2-4f72-a382-c4981983d00e_1672x941.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369554931"},{"id":369548817,"date":"2026-10-25T00:42:49.762Z","text":"Meet me where imagination becomes a universe.","likes":14,"restacks":2,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369548817"},{"id":369488951,"date":"2026-10-24T22:43:52.930Z","text":"🗝️for later.","likes":37,"restacks":9,"replies":3,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f698a5a8-c7b4-4e0c-8878-0a3ff69607ea_1122x1402.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369488951"},{"id":369421647,"date":"2026-10-24T20:54:24.682Z","text":"I release what no longer reflects who I am becoming. I honor who I have been, reclaim my energy, and make room for what feels true now.\n\n▀▄▀▄▀▄ (new post)\n\nhttps://substack.com/home/post/p-221907011","likes":16,"restacks":3,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b0b81733-c665-4661-a1cc-b38301a18486_1027x1531.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369421647"},{"id":369382439,"date":"2026-10-24T19:57:32.492Z","text":"","likes":5,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369382439"},{"id":369095142,"date":"2026-10-24T14:00:02.441Z","text":"🪴Earth is not a resource, it’s a relationship.","likes":14,"restacks":2,"replies":2,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/bd481091-204a-481d-97c2-56c0d8aef492_1222x1833.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369095142"},{"id":369067939,"date":"2026-10-24T13:00:16.889Z","text":"this is the shift","likes":38,"restacks":9,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2723606